#%RAML 1.0 DataType
(package): Agent
type: object
displayName: AgentResponsesRequest
description: |
  JSON body for an `application/json` [/responses](/api/agents/intake-agent#create-a-cart-or-quote-request) request to the Intake Agent. `prompt` is required.

  To attach files, send a `multipart/form-data` request with an [AgentResponsesPayload](ctp:api:type:AgentResponsesPayload) as the `payload` part.
example: !include ../../examples/agent/AgentResponsesRequest.json
properties:
  outputType:
    type: AgentResponsesOutputType
    description: |
      The entity to create.
  locale:
    type: string
    description: |
      A valid BCP 47 language tag, for example `en-US`.
  prompt:
    type: string
    description: |
      Natural-language description of the desired Cart or Quote Request, such as the body of an email or a note.
  businessUnit?:
    type: BusinessUnitResourceIdentifier
    description: |
      [BusinessUnit](ctp:api:type:BusinessUnit) to use for the request. If omitted, the Intake Agent resolves it from `prompt`.
  store?:
    type: StoreResourceIdentifier
    description: |
      [Store](ctp:api:type:Store) to use for the request. If omitted, the Intake Agent resolves it from `prompt`.
